# tally 2.2.1, P48 B2: a quantile's none level under a binding names its key's value (review g3
# wb/g2_min). Before W12: rate[k].
=== g2_min.tally
model g2_min
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
index ks = [k1, k2]
input rate[k in ks]: num
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  rate[k1] = 1 "s"
  rate[k2] = none "s"
ask t: quantile(rate[j] for j in [k1], rate[k]) for k in ks where k == k2
=== expect
t (k = k2): refused: RUN-NONE rate[k2] is none here: the level of quantile
  cut 2026-06-10
